Let me check the plan/spec for any indication. Let me grep spec for GetValue. Actually the task spec only says "测试越界 IsValidPixel 与 GetValue". I need to define sensible semantics. Since the map is a defensive utility and safety-first project (unknown = obstacle), returning -1 (unknown) for out-of-bounds reads is the safest — out-of-map reads as unknown → treated as obstacle downstream. I'll document that clearly and test it.

Also SetValue out-of-range: no-op (defensive).

